            "x": 0,
            "y": 1
          },
          "id": 2,
          "options": {
            "content": "**Purpose.** Machine health (USE: utilisation, saturation, errors) for the service pods and the JVMs in them.\n\n**Use it when** a service is slow or restarting and the Service dashboard points to resources, not code.\n\n**How to read it**\n- Pods row: throttling (CPU limit hit) or memory near 90% of the limit come before slow requests and OOMKills. Restarts and the OOMKilled stat confirm it.\n- JVM & cats-effect row: heap, GC time, starvation and pool waits for every service. Click a series to open that service.\n- Monitoring: every scrape target should be green, or other panels go quiet for the wrong reason.\n\n**Background:** [USE method (best practices)](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/latest/dashboards/build-dashboards/best-practices/) \u00b7 [Hierarchy of needs](https://grafana.com/docs/learning-hub/intro-to-grafana-cloud/00-intro/02-hierarchy-of-needs) \u00b7 [Microservice monitoring](https://www.sysdig.com/blog/microservice-monitoring)",
            "mode": "markdown"
          },
          "repeatDirection": "h",
          "title": "",
          "transparent": false,
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this dashboard",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      },
      "id": 3,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "Pods (USE)",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "cores"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11
      },
      "id": 4,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [],
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "repeatDirection": "h",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (pod) (rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{pod_uid!=\"\"}[$__rate_interval]) * on (pod_uid) group_left (pod) label_replace(kube_pod_info{pod=~\"$pod\"}, \"pod_uid\", \"$1\", \"uid\", \"(.*)\"))",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (pod) (kube_pod_container_resource_limits{resource=\"cpu\", pod=~\"$pod\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}} limit",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "title": "CPU (cores) vs limit",
      "transparent": false,
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 11
      },
      "id": 5,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [],
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "repeatDirection": "h",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (pod) (container_memory_working_set_bytes{pod_uid!=\"\"} * on (pod_uid) group_left (pod) label_replace(kube_pod_info{pod=~\"$pod\"}, \"pod_uid\", \"$1\", \"uid\", \"(.*)\"))",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (pod) (kube_pod_container_resource_limits{resource=\"memory\", pod=~\"$pod\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}} limit",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Memory working set vs limit",
      "transparent": false,
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "The pod wanted more CPU than its limit allows, so latency goes up.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 11
